  "qualification": "Baseline for the matched Builder file-selection and output policy. Exact API comparison passes for zstd; zlib and SQLite omit two array-parameter typedef aliases, SQLite has a C-validated callback correction, and libgit2 emits twelve additional aliases. Three shared sentinel constants require explicit unsigned conversion to match the native C value. Native probes and actual FFI calls pass within the documented preflight scope. These timings measure generation, not compilation or complete application performance. They are not comparable as a revision speedup against the earlier core-route workload.",
